    "products": [
      "Explore the tools inside each app, then step straight into your next experiment."
    ],
    "tutorials": [
      "Follow the actual controls, from finding the feature to your first interaction. Go at your pace and replay whenever you need.",
      "Put your hands into the experiment.",
      "Explore → Sandbox → Hands. Learn to grab, move and release objects, then switch the camera off.",
      "Find your way around the lab.",
      "Dissection Lab → instrument tray → Use my hands. Learn to aim, pinch and follow the first objective.",
      "Guides work without a camera. Biology hand tracking requires a desktop webcam; mouse and touch controls are available."
    ],
    "newsroom": [],
    "platform": [
      "Every product is engineered around the same conviction — that confidence, not content, is what most learners are missing.",
      "Use the Entelloq logo at the bottom left of any app to open Physics, Quant or Biology, or return here.",
      "Assistance designed to rebuild belief and intuition — never to think in the learner's place.",
      "Early versions of every Entelloq product are available free of charge — understanding should not depend on resources."
    ],
    "proof": [
      "Quant Entelloq launched in July 2026. The numbers below are real, and updated as the network grows."
    ],
    "leadership": [
      "Darsh Prasad founded Entelloq Networks after observing, first in physics classrooms and later in financial markets, that the people who struggle to learn are rarely the least capable — more often, they are the ones who have quietly stopped believing they could understand . Existing platforms address isolated stages of learning; Entelloq is built for what happens between them.",
      "He designs and engineers every Entelloq product end-to-end — the physics simulation engine, the market-practice environment and the biology atlas — as one connected platform rather than a collection of separate tools.",
      "“Technology achieves its highest purpose not when it thinks for people, but when it gives people the confidence to think for themselves.” Darsh Prasad — South Asian Herald, July 2026"
    ],
    "company": [
      "Entelloq — pronounced en-TELL-ock.",
      "Mission",
      "Intelligence. Innovation. Impact. To take learners from “I don’t understand this” to “I finally get it” — by pairing rigorous content with AI that restores confidence rather than replacing effort.",
      "Vision",
      "An environment rather than a tool: a connected platform of specialised learning worlds, where every discipline receives a complete product and understanding does not depend on where someone starts.",
      "The name",
      "EN — intelligent communication. TEL — expanding learning. LOQ — expanding options in trading, with quantitative precision. The name carries the mission: en-TELL-ock .",
      "Milestones",
      "The company’s first product opens to the public, free of charge.",
      "21+ live simulations and 89+ mapped concepts across six explanatory lenses.",
      "National press coverage of the platform and its founding story.",
      "The dissection laboratory, Explore atlas and Biology Universe come together.",
      "Recognised for innovation in physics and science education.",
      "Within weeks of launch, the platform serves 700+ registered learners."
    ]
